r/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1535110/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1535110/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は大阪の時とは全然違う感じよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1535110/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会始めて？のスキニーなんだぜ！それでね、前回のアンケートで白のワンピ見たいって方多かったんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白のワンピはさすがに季節が夏すぎるから、白のシャツもいいかな？っていうのがコンセプトです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もみんな来てくれてありがとうね(*^o^*)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったよ！テンション高いねって言われちゃった。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあそんなあみも好きでしょ？？ね？は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の全握までみんな楽しみに待ってるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1535110/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返すのさ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.ショートにしたのは気分ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.うん、気分だし、長い間ロングだったからさっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.どの教科が得意？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.んーー、意外と英語？うん、意外と。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.あみあみの握手会での攻略法は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.特にいろいろ考えず、あみが楽しむようにしてる！そしたらきっと伝わるから(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.ちなみにこの写真の撮影者は誰ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ひなちまだよーーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.他にも天然エピソードありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.もうなんかいろいろありすぎて本当に覚えてないっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"情けねぇ。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い出したらいちいちブログに書くね ( ◞˟૩˟)◞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.眉毛の上にあるのはほくろ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ちがうよー！加工したらついちゃつた(⊙◞౪◟⊙)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.すんごい疲れてるときってなにしますかぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.とにかく、寝る！それか友達と話して紛らわす！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.どうやったら体柔らかなると思う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.お風呂上がり毎日かかさずストレス！でも痛いの無理しすぎると危ないから気をつけてっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.朝食は何派⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.俄然パン！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.年下の女の子に推されるってどうですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.嬉しい嬉しいっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子嬉しいよ❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.あみあみ族にどうしたら入ったことになるの？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみのこと好きになった時点で？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.そうだよ！あ、もしかして、あみあみのこと好きかも......って思った時点であみあみ族加入だよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.今日のお昼は何だろうね？ハンバーグかな？それともカレーかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.今日は、麻婆豆腐ご飯だった！あと杏仁豆腐！！おーいしかった(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまでーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうみんなに会いたいよぅ...。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1535110/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから次の握手会も絶対来てね(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐぇーぐぇー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/1535110/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変顔でばいばーい(*^^*)にこにこ"}],"source":"archive"}